{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Devil Within: Satgat \u2013 Official Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the haunting soundscape of <i>The Devil Within: Satgat</i> with 23 original tracks that blend atmospheric tension and Eastern-inspired melodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Composed by a team of talented artists, this soundtrack also features special tracks by <strong>Matthew Kiichi Heafy</strong>, lead vocalist and guitarist of the metal band <strong>Trivium</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From haunting ambient themes to high-intensity battle music, each track immerses you deeper into the game\u2019s emotional and mythic world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642230?t=1745198271","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642230?t=1745198271","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642230/36cfe6bd9da6f2cd566a7d9702787443edf7344f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745198271","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642230/36cfe6bd9da6f2cd566a7d9702787443edf7344f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745198271","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Devil Within: Satgat \u2013 Official Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the haunting soundscape of <i>The Devil Within: Satgat</i> with 23 original tracks that blend atmospheric tension and Eastern-inspired melodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Composed by a team of talented artists, this soundtrack also features special tracks by <strong>Matthew Kiichi Heafy</strong>, lead vocalist and guitarist of the metal band <strong>Trivium</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From haunting ambient themes to high-intensity battle music, each track im